# Restriction checkboxes for UNO_EssentialOData_v1.tt (see Docs/Reference.md section 3).
# One of the files the Uno OData pages need: no table and no database, only the project settings. Run it from the Essentials menu or `codegen essentials`; OData=true ticks it.
Scope=None
Stacks=Uno
EssentialsGroup=OData
EssentialsDefault=false
Description=Services/ODataSupport.cs: the OData query helper, the filter kinds and the client base of the Uno OData pages (OData=true); needs the Support group
